  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is as follows:\n\n**(2nd number ÷ 1st number) - 1 = 3rd number**\n\nGiven,\n\n(17, 136, 7) \n\n⇒ (136 ÷ 17) - 1 = 7\n\n⇒ 8 – 1 = 7\n\n⇒ **7 = 7**\n\n(12, 120, 9)\n\n⇒ (120 ÷ 12) - 1 = 9\n\n⇒ 10 - 1 = 9\n\n⇒ **9 = 9**\n\nBy checking the options,\n\n1. (11, 99, 9)\n\n⇒(99 ÷ 11) - 1 = 9\n\n⇒9 - 1 = 9\n\n⇒**8 ****≠ 9**\n\n2. (16, 85, 5)\n\n⇒(85 ÷ 16) - 1 = 5\n\n⇒5.312 - 1 = 5\n\n⇒**4.312 ****≠ 5**\n\n3. (15, 125, 7)\n\n⇒(125 ÷ 15) - 1 = 7\n\n⇒(8.333 - 1) = 7\n\n⇒**7.333 ****≠ 7**\n\n **4. (14, 126, 8)**\n\n**⇒(126 ÷ 14) - 1 = 8**\n\n**⇒9 - 1 = 8**\n\n**⇒8 = 8**\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"option (4)\".**",
